<P STYLE="font: 14pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; color: #02C8BB"><B>XP Inc. To Cancel Treasury Shares</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 14pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; color: #02C8BB">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><B>S&atilde;o Paulo, Brazil,
August 17, 2026 &ndash; </B>XP Inc. (Nasdaq: XP), announced today that its board of directors has approved the cancellation of existing
treasury Class A shares held by the Company.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white">The Company has cancelled
in this date 11,791,755 Class A shares (2.3% of total shares). Total share count went from 520,292,030 to 508,500,275 after cancellation.</P>

